MID_Shop_Tool: Item Shop
MID_Shop_Blacksmith: Blacksmith
MID_Shop_Market: Marketplace
MID_Shop_Drink: Drink Vendor
MID_Shop_Legion: Transport Chief
MID_Shop_Trader: Merchant
MID_Shop_Talimun: Vandahl Trading Co.
MID_Shop_Anna: Anna's Shop
MID_Shop_Bill: License Vendor
MID_Shop_Bazaar: Market
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat01: Goat Roast
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat01_Help: Seasoned goat meat grilled to\nperfection. Savory and juicy, with a\nmouthwatering herbal aroma.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat02: Salt-Crusted Ham
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat02_Help: Sand-boar meat rubbed with rock\nsalt and smoked for hours. The\nsmell and salty taste are irresistible.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat03: Sand Boar and Beans
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat03_Help: Bitter beans stewed with tender\nchunks of sand-boar meat, creating\na pleasing harmony for the palate.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat04: Sweet-and-Sour Stick Bugs
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Meat04_Help: Stick bugs that have been deep-\nfried to give their delicate meat a\ncrispy texture. A Saramis delicacy.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish01: Garlic-Seared Scallops
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish01_Help: Scallops slathered in fat and slowly\ngrilled over charcoal. A luxurious\nmeeting of land and sea.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish02: Fish-Sauce Soup
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish02_Help: Seafood served in a rich broth and\ndrizzled with fish sauce. It's almost\nimpossible not to clean your bowl.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish03: Charred Fish Grill
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish03_Help: A classic meal of freshly caught fish\nturned over coals. Delicious to the\nlast morsel, even the bitter guts.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish04: Cheese-Coated Crayfish
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Fish04_Help: Large crayfish topped in cheese\nand broiled to bring out the flavors.\nA gorgeous, vibrantly colored dish.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee01: Honey-Poached Pear
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee01_Help: Sweet, crisp pears that have been\ncooked in honey, making for a\nsumptuous culinary experience.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee02: Madazins
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee02_Help: Buns made by kneading veggies\ninto bakul dough and frying them.\nDelicious as a snack or meal.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee03: Coffee-Berry Paste
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee03_Help: A sweet, light puree of simmered\ncoffee berries, enjoyed by being\ndoused liberally on various foods.
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee04: Pumpkin Soup
MID_DiningMenu_Recipe_Vegee04_Help: Hearty vegetable soup served in a\nhollowed-out pumpkin. The sweet\nand spicy notes make it addictive.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring01: Hot Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring01_Help: A piping-hot bath that improves\ncirculation. Allows abilities such as\nStr Effect and Crit Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring02: Refreshing Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring02_Help: A bath with a gentle temperature.\nAllows abilities such as Spd Effect\nand Avo Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring03: Medicinal Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring03_Help: An herbal bath that soothes the\nbody. Allows abilities such as Fury\nand Bld Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring04: Floral Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Spring04_Help: A bath in flower-strewn waters.\nAllows abilities such as Heal Effect\nand Mag Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA01: Ruby Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA01_Help: A revitalizing bath among crushed\nrubies. Allows abilities such as Str\nEffect and Arts Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA02: Gold Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA02_Help: A bath whose top layer shimmers\nin gold powder. Allows abilities\nsuch as Avo Effect and Revitalize.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA03: Jade Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA03_Help: An invigorating bath purified in a\njade bathtub. Allows abilities such\nas Fury and Hit Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA04: Adamant Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringA04_Help: A bath of waters drawn from the\nearth's depths. Allows abilities\nsuch as Crit Effect and Daring.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB01: Swift-Wind Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB01_Help: A bath with fruits that cool the\nbody. Allows abilities such as Spd\nEffect and Avo Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB02: Tree of Life Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB02_Help: A nourishing bath alongside\nfloating wood. Allows abilities such\nas Revitalize and Follow-Up Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB03: Volcanic Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB03_Help: A bath with volcanic stones to boost\none's fighting spirit. Allows abilities\nsuch as Crit Effect and Daring.
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB04: Full-Moon Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_SpringB04_Help: Sacred water, blessed under a full moon.\nAllows abilities such as Str Effect\nand Dex Effect.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special01: Giants' Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special01_Help: From the waters of Atla's huge\nhot spring. Allows abilities such as\nStr Effect+ and Crit Effect+.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special02: Unicorns' Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special02_Help: From a hot spring on Orgus visited\nby magical beasts. Allows abilities\nsuch as Spd Effect+ and Avo Effect+.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special03: Sea-Tyrant's Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special03_Help: From a hidden hot spring in the\nLir Sea. Allows abilities such as\nHP Effect+ and Def Effect+.
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special04: Harpyrian Bath
MID_ThermaeMenu_Special04_Help: From a hot spring on the heights of\nOuranos. Allows abilities such as\nHeal Effect+ and Mag Effect+.
MID_VolunteerMenu_Pray: Clean Temple
MID_VolunteerMenu_Pray_Help: Serve in Aurora's temple. By calming your\nmind and purifying the temple, you can receive\nthe goddess's divine protection.
MID_VolunteerMenu_Guard: Guard Temple
MID_VolunteerMenu_Guard_Help: Serve in Mars's temple. By helping to guard the\ntemple, you can gain the god's divine protection.
MID_VolunteerMenu_Caring: Look After Cats
MID_VolunteerMenu_Caring_Help: Serve in Smyrnos's temple—in an unusual way.\nBy caring for the cats in the temple, you can\ngain the god's blessing.
MID_VolunteerMenu_Library: Organize Library
MID_VolunteerMenu_Library_Help: Serve in Jurah's temple. By organizing the\ntemple's vast collection of texts, you can gain\nthe goddess's blessing.
MID_VolunteerMenu_Song: Offer Hymns
MID_VolunteerMenu_Song_Help: Serve in Kalla's temple. By joining the temple\nchoir and singing with heart, you can gain the\ngoddess's blessing.
MID_VolunteerMenu_Statue: Work on Statues
MID_VolunteerMenu_Statue_Help: Serve in Credna's temple. By creating and\nrestoring statues in the temple, you can receive\nthe god's blessing.
MID_TrainingMenu_Training01: Infantry Training
MID_TrainingMenu_Training01_Help: Learn the basic fighting techniques\nof an infantry soldier. Focuses on\nswords, bows, and infantry skills.
MID_TrainingMenu_Training02: Warrior Training
MID_TrainingMenu_Training02_Help: Learn how to wield the various\nweapons of gladiators. Focuses on\nswords, axes, and brawling.
MID_TrainingMenu_Training03: Heavy Training
MID_TrainingMenu_Training03_Help: Learn the skills of heavily armored\nsoldiers. Focuses on authority,\nspears, axes, and heavy armor.
MID_TrainingMenu_Training04: Mage Training
MID_TrainingMenu_Training04_Help: Improve attack and recovery magic\nabilities. Focuses on black and\nwhite magic as well as authority.
MID_TrainingMenu_Training05: Mounted Training
MID_TrainingMenu_Training05_Help: Learn the skills of a mounted\nsoldier. Focuses on spears, riding,\nand flying, as well as authority.
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_01: Adv. Infantry Training
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_01_Help: Learn advanced infantry combat\ntechniques. Focuses on swords,\nbows, and infantry skills.
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_02: Adv. Warrior Training
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_02_Help: Learn weapon skills from veteran\ngladiators' teachings. Focuses on\nswords, axes, and brawling.
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_03: Adv. Heavy Training
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_03_Help: Learn sophisticated heavy-armor\ntechniques. Focuses on authority,\nspears, axes, and heavy armor.
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_04: Adv. Mage Training
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_04_Help: Learn advanced magic techniques.\nFocuses on black and white magic\nas well as authority.
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_05: Adv. Mounted Training
MID_TrainingMenu_TrainingP3_05_Help: Rigorous training for cavalry and\nfliers. Focuses on authority as well\nas spears, riding, and flying.
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_05: 
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_05_Help: 
MID_WatchMenu_WD13_04: Qualifier: Forgotten Alcor
MID_WatchMenu_WD13_04_Help: It's the day Forgotten Alcor has\ntheir match against other clans.\nWatch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_06: Qualifier: Thundercloud Knights
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_06_Help: It's the day the Thundercloud\nKnights have their match against\nother clans. Watch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD14_06: Qualifier: Rains of Palma
MID_WatchMenu_WD14_06_Help: It's the day the Rains of Palma has\ntheir match against other clans.\nWatch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_09: 
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_09_Help: 
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_10: Qualifier: Twin Jewels of Arago
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_10_Help: It's the day the Aragonian Army\nhas their match against other clans.\nWatch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_09: Qualifier: Bragança Brotherhood
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_09_Help: It's the day the Bragança Brotherhood\nhas their match against other clans.\nWatch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD15_11: Exhibition: White-Maned Demon vs. The Reaper
MID_WatchMenu_WD15_11_Help: It's the day of the exhibition match\nof the White-Maned Demon and\nthe Reaper. Watch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_10: Main Match: Cai vs. Leda
MID_WatchMenu_WD11_10_Help: It's the day of the match between\nRibeira Winds and Rose Tempest.\nWatch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD13_11: Main Match: Theodora vs. Talimun
MID_WatchMenu_WD13_11_Help: It's the day of the match between\nMegaira's Beacon and Tale of the\nMoon. Watch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD15_13: Main Match: Bertrand vs. Orchel
MID_WatchMenu_WD15_13_Help: It's the day of the match between\nthe Fiery Mane and Linaria\nDewdrops. Watch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_15: Main Match: Dietrich vs. Anatolia
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_15_Help: It's the day of the match between\nHouse Lamine and the Bridal Party of\nthe Pale Raven. Watch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD13_12: Semifinal: Cai vs. Theodora
MID_WatchMenu_WD13_12_Help: It's the day of the match between\nRibeira Winds and Megaira's\nBeacon. Watch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_16: Semifinal: Dietrich vs. Bertrand
MID_WatchMenu_WD12_16_Help: It's the day of the match between\nHouse Lamine and the Fiery Mane.\nWatch at the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_WatchMenu_BD15_08: 
MID_WatchMenu_BD15_08_Help: 
MID_WatchMenu_WD15_09: Private Match: White-Maned Demon vs. Yanjin
MID_WatchMenu_WD15_09_Help: It's the day of the private match of\nthe White-Maned Demon and Yanjin.\nWatch at the Crystal Palace.
MID_Lesson_Title_Explanation1: Combat Basics
MID_Lesson_Detail_Explanation1: Cai, I have long fought for the safety of Aurora, and\nto maintain peace in Dagsion. So I would like to\ndiscuss the proper mindset for battle.
MID_Lesson_Title_Explanation2: Terrain Tips
MID_Lesson_Detail_Explanation2: There's plenty I wanted to teach you, but we ran out\nof time. Now that I'm locked up, I can't demonstrate,\nbut I can talk you through it... So pay attention.
MID_Lesson_Title_Explanation3: Staying Healthy
MID_Lesson_Detail_Explanation3: You're so much like your father, Cai. I worry you\nmight fight just as recklessly. I'd like to offer some\nadvice, rather than see you hurt in combat.
MID_Lesson_Title_Practice1: Know Your Enemy
MID_Lesson_Detail_Practice1: In this vast world, there are foes with a variety of\nclasses and ways of fighting. You must learn the\ntechniques to defeat all of them. I've asked some\nfriends to face you so you can begin to grasp this.
MID_Lesson_Title_Practice2: Against Large Foes
MID_Lesson_Detail_Practice2: You may need to fight large enemies, like giants or\nwar elephants. So, we will train in a proper battle\nto help you avoid panic in the future.
MID_Lesson_Title_Subjugation1: Special Request from Pop
MID_Lesson_Detail_Subjugation1: I have a request for you to complete as part of your\ntraining. Once it's done, I will arrange for you to take\na certification exam for a new class.
MID_Lesson_Title_Subjugation2: Special Request from Mom
MID_Lesson_Detail_Subjugation2: If you can fulfill my request, the temples are ready\nto offer you the opportunity to take a certification\nexam for a new class.
MID_Lesson_Title_Subjugation3: White-Maned Demon's Request
MID_Lesson_Detail_Subjugation3: You have a practical fighting technique—one I'd\nguess you learned from your mentor. In that case,\nbest your experience is practical as well. Do your best\nto fulfill this request.
