MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Bill: License Vendor
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Bill_Help: A place where you can purchase the licenses\nrequired to take a {Lowercase}Certification Exam{NormalCase}.
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Market: Midtown Marketplace
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Market_Help: A shop offering a wide variety of valuable gifts,\nincluding local delicacies and works of art.
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Bar: Tavern Marketplace
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Bar_Help: Sells reasonably priced gifts to barflies in\na corner of the tavern.
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Weapon: Armory
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Weapon_Help: A specialty shop offering a wide selection of\nweapons commonly found throughout the land.
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Tool: Item Shop
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Tool_Help: A specialty store offering a wide variety of tools\nuseful for dangerous adventures.
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Anna: Anna's Shop
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Anna_Help: Anna's secret shop offering rare items seldom\nfound elsewhere.
MID_Map_Facility_Subquest_Hotel: City Streets Bulletin Board
MID_Map_Facility_Subquest_Temple: Temple Row Bulletin Board
MID_Map_Facility_Subquest_Affluent: Hightown Bulletin Board
MID_Map_Facility_Subquest_Port: Port Bulletin Board
MID_Map_Facility_Subquest_Help: A notice board where shops and guilds post\nmessages. Fulfill their requests to raise renown\nand claim fine rewards.
MID_Map_Facility_LegionShop: Transport Chief
MID_Map_Facility_LegionShop_Help: Handles dispatching battalions to Saramis.\nAwards useful items in return for improving the\nkingdom's defenses.
MID_Map_Facility_Blacksmith: Blacksmith
MID_Map_Facility_Blacksmith_Help: Repairs damaged weapons or refines them into\nstronger ones.
MID_Map_Facility_Theater: Theater
MID_Map_Facility_Theater_Help: A theater showing popular plays. You can invite\nallies to strengthen your bond, or even play a\nrole on stage if your renown is high enough.
MID_Map_Facility_Hotel: City Inn
MID_Map_Facility_Hotel_Help: A place for travelers visiting Dagsion to rest\nand relax. Take a break, share a meal to deepen\nbonds, or automatically spend your spare time.
MID_Map_Facility_Hotel_2_Help: Lodging for soldiers to rest in the base of\noperations. You cannot rent a room or share\nmeals, but you can view support conversations.
MID_Map_Facility_Hotel_Slums: Lowtown Inn
MID_Map_Facility_Hotel_Slums_Help: A fine option for Dagsion's poorer visitors.\nIt doesn't offer meals, but you can catch some\nsleep or automatically spend your spare time.
MID_Map_Facility_Thermae: Thermae
MID_Map_Facility_Thermae_Help: One of Dagda's finest public baths. Soaking with\nsomeone you'd like to get close to deepens your\nbond while restoring body and mind.
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Aurora: Aurora's Branch Temple
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Claire: Credna's Branch Temple
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Carla: Kalla's Branch Temple
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Smyrnos: Smyrnos's Branch Temple
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Mars: Mars's Branch Temple
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Jura: Jurah's Branch Temple
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Help: A sanctum for audiences with the gods and acts\nof {LowercaseNextLetter}Service. Perform {LowercaseNextLetter}Service together to deepen\nbonds and receive blessings.
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_2_Help: A simple shrine for devout soldiers where you\ncan select blessings. For temple service, speak\nto the {Lowercase}Dispatch Officer{NormalCase}.
MID_Map_Facility_ClassExaminer: Exam Proctor
MID_Map_Facility_ClassExaminer_Help: You can take {Lowercase}Certification Exam{NormalCase}s here. You will\nneed a license of the appropriate rank for the\nclass exam you wish to take.
MID_Map_Facility_StableBlock: Stable
MID_Map_Facility_StableBlock_Help: A place to keep captured animals. Take care of\nthem to grow closer and even name them.
MID_Map_Facility_Perch_Hotel: City Streets Perch
MID_Map_Facility_Perch_Temple: Temple Row Perch
MID_Map_Facility_Perch_Affluent: Hightown Perch
MID_Map_Facility_Perch_Port: Port Perch
MID_Map_Facility_Perch_Underground: Underground Perch
MID_Map_Facility_Perch_Help: No one knows who built this perch or when.\nAn odd white bird often rests here, and it is\nrumored to be friendly with people.
MID_Map_Facility_Perch_2_Help: A perch someone brought into camp. The white\nbird won't appear while you're on the march, but\nyou can still check Notable Deeds and Foresight.
MID_Map_Facility_Firm: Vandahl Trading Co.
MID_Map_Facility_Firm_Help: A place to barter materials. Their goal is to\nconnect people with goods, and they handle\neverything from everyday items to rare finds.
MID_Map_Facility_TempleWarp: Gate of the Gods
MID_Map_Facility_TempleWarp_Help: A mysterious gate that connects a main temple\nto a branch temple. Using one to travel requires\nthe permission of its god.
MID_Map_Facility_Arena: Arena
MID_Map_Facility_Arena_Help: The grand arena of the Dagdan Empire. A holy\nsite for battle where gladiators clash day and\nnight. One section is reserved for training.
MID_Map_Facility_Divination: Divination Booth
MID_Map_Facility_Divination_Help: A soothsayer popular in Dagsion who predicts\none's fate through curious methods. Whether\nyou believe the results is up to you.
MID_Map_Facility_DitArranger: Headhunter
MID_Map_Facility_DitArranger_Help: A mysterious figure with unique connections to\nskilled warriors across Dagda. Passes along\nchallenge letters from these powerful fighters.
MID_Map_Facility_SeoProcurement: Send Supplies
MID_Map_Facility_SeoProcurement_Help: You can send relief supplies to Saramis from\nhere. When Queen Theodora delivers the goods\nherself, she earns renown and funds.
MID_Map_Facility_LedShowman: Tavern Owner
MID_Map_Facility_LedShowman_Help: A performance booker who recognizes Leda's\ntalent. Completing gigs earns her new\nspellsongs and travel routes.
MID_Map_Facility_LedDrinkSeller: Drink Vendor
MID_Map_Facility_LedDrinkSeller_Help: Keeper of a secret menu whose special blends\ngreatly enhance one's abilities. New drinks are\navailable as Leda gains renown.
MID_Map_Facility_Revivalist: Tavern Owner
MID_Map_Facility_Revivalist_Help: A performance booker who recognizes Leda's\ntalent and hires her to inspire courage and\nhope in her audiences.
MID_Map_Facility_SortiePlan: Dispatch Officer
MID_Map_Facility_SortiePlan_Help: Oversees training and deployment during\nwartime. Also arranges services at the temple.
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Main: Temple Reception
MID_Map_Facility_Temple_Main_Help: Acts of {LowercaseNextLetter}Service can be performed here. Those\nwho perform {LowercaseNextLetter}Service together deepen their\nbonds and are granted greater blessings.
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Bazaar: Market
MID_Map_Facility_Shop_Bazaar_Help: A small market where merchants sell wares\nprocured from various regions. They mainly\ndeal in gifts.
MID_AreaTelop_UpperLayer: Hightown
MID_AreaTelop_MiddleLayer: Midtown
MID_AreaTelop_UnderLayer: Lowtown
MID_AreaTelop_Guest_Salamis: Saramis Guesthouse
MID_AreaTelop_Guest_Arago: Arago Guesthouse
MID_AreaTelop_Arena_Underground: Arena Underground
MID_AreaTelop_Sewar: Sewers
MID_AreaTelop_Shop_Bar: Tavern
